BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7b220952599b49292c0e74bf145db13ed654c76fce3a054ac3a4942d7e2cd510@pruts-
 agenda.local
DTSTAMP:20260924T124549Z
SUMMARY:FCA Sunday Feminist Discussion: Feminism and AI
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20260927T140000Z
DTEND:20260927T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:AI now plays a major role in our daily use of technology. The u
 se of generative AI tools is putting into question authorship\, academic f
 raud and data privacy. Through numerous examples\, AI is recreating racist
  as well as misogynistic biases in its answers to its users. Not only is A
 I recreating biases\, but its use by some users is being extremely harmful
  to women and children\, in the case of generated AI porn\, for instance. 
 AI's impact on society goes even further through its effect on our environ
 ment. As AI use grows day by day\, legislation struggles to keep pace\, an
 d many legislators and governments fail to understand the urgency of contr
 olling it. Our discussion is aimed at questioning our use of AI\, its impa
 ct on our daily lives\, as well as its dangers to our data privacy\, and w
 hether there are ways for us to act\; what are they?
LOCATION:Amsterdam Netherlands
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/event/amsterdam/feminist-club-amsterdam/2026
 -09-27/fca-sunday-feminist-discussion-feminism-and-ai
CATEGORIES:discussion/presentation
END:VEVENT
