SUMMARY:The Hmm @ Brainwash Festival
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261031T180000Z
DTEND:20261031T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Hmm presents AI\, AI\, AI @ Brainwash festival\nWe use algo
 rithms\, platforms and AI-driven tools every day\, often without really un
 derstanding what’s happening behind the screen. The Hmm’s educational 
 programme\, ‘ai\, ai\, ai’\, turns these invisible systems into someth
 ing you can see\, understand\, question and play with. During Brainwash fe
 stival we’re launching our latest workshops—not involving AI\, but abo
 ut AI—specially designed for children aged 8 and over\, and their parent
 s. You can experience ‘Make your own Slopject’ and ‘Squish the Syste
 m’ at Brainwash festival Ijzaal. \nMake your own Slopject\nDo you ever s
 top to think that everything you do online is being tracked? Every ‘like
 ’\, every scroll and every second you spend watching a video tells us so
 mething about you. All those little bits of information together are what 
 we call data. Algorithms use that data to try and predict what you like\, 
 so you see more of that sort of content and adverts. Handy\, perhaps\, but
  is it actually always fair? \nIn the ‘Make your own Slopject’ worksho
 p\, you’ll step into the role of an algorithm yourself. In exchange for 
 handing over your own data\, you’ll receive a token with which you can d
 raw (or ‘buy’) another person’s data profile from the ball machine. 
 What does this person watch? What music do they listen to? What do they se
 arch for online? Afterwards\, you’ll design (or mould) a collectable fig
 urine that you’re almost certain the person behind the data profile woul
 d want to buy. \nSquish the System: from facts to vibes\nFor a long time\,
  the rule was: if there’s a photo of it\, it must have happened. We now 
 live in an age where any photo could just as easily have been created by A
 I. Every day we’re inundated with photos\, videos and memes\, not intend
 ed to tell a story\, but to make you feel something: curious\, restless\, 
 in love with a product. Enough to keep you looking\, clicking\, buying som
 ething. It’s not just people watching. Algorithms are squishing the worl
 d around us into categories they can understand. \nImages\, therefore\, re
 fer less and less to anything\, and increasingly demand something from us.
  A squishy is the perfect object to explore this. It isn’t made to be lo
 oked at\, but to do something with: grab it\, squeeze it\, be unable to le
 t it go. Just like the images around us. \nIn this workshop\, you’re not
  a consumer of images\, but a creator. You’ll design your own paper squi
 shy with a mission: an object that says nothing\, but triggers a specific 
 sensation. How do you make it go viral? Which aesthetic works for that\, a
 nd with which target audience? And what does it need to look like to achie
 ve that? \nAbout The Hmm\nThe Hmm is a platform for internet cultures. We 
 explore and celebrate the creativity that arises from virtual interactions
  and the interplay with the technologies that make them possible. Through 
 accessible events\, research\, exhibitions and educational programmes\, we
  offer a curious audience playful and engaging insights into online life. 
 The workshops ‘Make your own Slopject’ and ‘Squish the System: from 
 facts to vibes’ have been developed in collaboration with artist Maria M
 ombers\, who is also one of The Hmm’s tutors. \nAbout Brainwash Festival
  \nBrainwash Festival is the place to be for thought-provoking ideas and v
 isions of the future. At Brainwash Festival\, philosophers\, scientists\, 
 artists and writers come together to explore the big questions of our time
  and challenge the status quo. We bring together established figures and n
 ew voices. We celebrate thinking\, doubt and your curiosity. \nBrainwash F
 estival 2026 takes up the theme ‘the shape of us’\, through which it e
 xplores\, from different perspectives\, what it means to live together. \n
 More information about the programme TBA. \n📅 Date: 31 October\n📍 To
 lhuistuin\n⏱️19:10h – 20:10h: Make your Own Slopject\n⏱️ 20:30h 
 – 21:30h: Squish the System \n🎟️ Tickets: via Brainwash\n♿ Access
 ibility notes\nFind more info on the Tolhuistuin website.
URL:https://thehmm.nl/event/the-hmm-brainwash-festival/
CATEGORIES:The Hmm
END:VEVENT
